"When finished, click the receipt or delivery order's breadcrumb, and the "
"assigned serial numbers are automatically saved."
msgstr ""
"When finished, click the receipt or delivery order's breadcrumb, and the "
"assigned serial numbers are automatically saved."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/serial_numbers.rst:290
msgid "Display serial numbers on delivery slips"
msgstr "Отображение серийных номеров в накладных на отгрузку"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/serial_numbers.rst:292
msgid ""
"When selling products tracked using serial numbers, it is possible to "
"include the serial numbers on the delivery slips sent to customers. This can "
"be helpful to customers in cases where serial numbers are needed, such as "
"filing an RMA or repair request, or registering the product."
msgstr ""
"При продаже товаров, отслеживаемых по серийным номерам, можно включить "
"серийные номера в накладные на отгрузку, отправляемые клиентам. Это может "
"быть полезно клиентам в случаях, когда необходимы серийные номера, например, "
"при подаче заявки на RMA или ремонт, или при регистрации товара."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/serial_numbers.rst:296
msgid ""
"To include serial numbers on delivery slips, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`Traceability` section, select the :guilabel:`Display "
"Lots & Serial Numbers on Delivery Slips` checkbox, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"To include serial numbers on delivery slips, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Scroll down "
"to the :guilabel:`Traceability` section, select the :guilabel:`Display Lots "
"& Serial Numbers on Delivery Slips` checkbox, and click :guilabel:`Save`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/serial_numbers.rst:301
msgid ""
"After enabling the :guilabel:`Display Lots & Serial Numbers on Delivery "
"Slips` setting, serial numbers are listed on delivery slips for products "
"tracked by serial numbers after the delivery order is validated."
msgstr ""
"After enabling the :guilabel:`Display Lots & Serial Numbers on Delivery "
"Slips` setting, serial numbers are listed on delivery slips for products "
"tracked by serial numbers after the delivery order is validated."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/serial_numbers.rst:305
