"продажу."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/delivery_three_steps.rst:105
msgid ""
"Delivery orders can *also* be accessed by going to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app --> Operations --> Deliveries`."
