"daily_operations/use_routes>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:184
msgid ""
"Configuring multiple routes per shipping method is helpful for adjusting "
"warehouse delivery processes based on:"
msgstr ""
"Настройка нескольких маршрутов для каждого способа доставки полезна для "
"корректировки процессов доставки со склада на основе:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:187
msgid ""
"speed (e.g., use :doc:`one-step delivery <../daily_operations/"
"receipts_delivery_one_step>` for express shipping, or :doc:`two-step <../"
"daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>` for standard shipping)."
msgstr ""
"скорости (например, использование :doc:`одношаговой доставки <../"
"daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step>` для экспресс-доставки "
"или :doc:`двухшаговой <../daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>` для "
"стандартной доставки)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:190
msgid ""
"international shipping (e.g. use :doc:`three-step delivery <../"
"daily_operations/delivery_three_steps>` to prepare documents for customs)"
msgstr ""
"международной доставки (например, использование :doc:`трёхшаговой доставки "
"<../daily_operations/delivery_three_steps>` для подготовки документов для "
"таможни)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:192
msgid ""
"in-store pickup or home delivery: ship from the central warehouse, or pick "
"from the store's stock, depending on customer selection."
msgstr ""
"самовывоза из магазина или доставки на дом: доставка с центрального склада "
"или получение из запасов магазина в зависимости от выбора клиента."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:195
msgid ""
"To set up routes, go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> "
