msgstr ""
"Чтобы настроить маршруты, перейдите в :menuselection:`Склад --> Настройка --"
"> Маршруты`. Нажмите :guilabel:`Создать` или выберите нужный маршрут."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:198
msgid ""
"On the route form, in the :guilabel:`Applicable On` section, tick "
"the :guilabel:`Shipping Methods` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"В форме маршрута в разделе :guilabel:`Применимо к` установите "
"флажок :guilabel:`Способы доставки`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:201
msgid "Routes form with the Shipping Methods checkbox selected."
msgstr "Форма маршрутов с выбранным флажком «Способы доставки»."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:204
msgid "Routes form with the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` checkbox ticked."
msgstr "Форма маршрутов с установленным флажком :guilabel:`Способ доставки`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:206
msgid ""
"Then, go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery "
"Methods`, and select the desired shipping method."
msgstr ""
