#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:188
msgid ""
"On the |MO|, click the :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`Shop Floor` smart "
"button. The |MO| opens in the *Shop Floor* module."
msgstr ""
"На |MO|, нажмите на смарт-кнопку :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`Цех`. "
